&lt;li&gt;Background in high-tech software sales is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of success in pipeline generation and quota attainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnership and co-selling experience is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player, hustler, all-around sales superstar&lt;/li&gt;
