&lt;p&gt;New Grads at Sigma are compensated with an hourly rate and relocation bonus (where applicable). Our hourly rate for this role is $65.00 per hour.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
