&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring new ideas to content strategy. Today Sigma leans heavily on blog and video — you&#39;ll run the blog, support video, and bring new thinking for expanded reach and awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in content marketing, ideally at a B2B SaaS or technology company through a high-growth stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional editing skills — you&#39;ve edited at volume and know how to balance technical accuracy with voice and taste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or adjacent to data, analytics, apps, or AI, with enough fluency in the concepts to edit credibly (and the judgment to pull in SMEs when you can&#39;t).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record running an editorial program or blog.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on SEO and AEO experience, including driving organic growth and search/answer-engine visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
