&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every Sigma experience — every query, every workbook, every agent interaction — runs on a platform that has to be fast, observable, and reliable at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As PM for AI Platform and Performance, you&#39;ll own the foundational capabilities that make that possible: query execution, compute and caching, metadata services, compiler components, agent infrastructure, platform observability, and data connectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for a technically strong PM who can move comfortably between infrastructure tradeoffs and customer conversations — and who gets energy from both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the roadmap for how Sigma&#39;s AI platform scales — AI tooling, cost management, compute, observability, connectors, and the query infrastructure that powers it all.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with enterprise customers to understand performance pain points and translate them into platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering to ship meaningful gains in latency, throughput, reliability, and cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the observability and agent monitoring capabilities that give customers and internal teams real visibility into how their workloads run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make active prioritization calls across a wide surface area, with clear reasoning behind every tradeoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience in B2B SaaS, data platforms, analytics, infrastructure, or developer-facing products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning and delivering a product roadmap end-to-end across technically complex areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of databases, distributed systems, query engines, caching, APIs, and cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tooling, agent monitoring, or platform diagnostics is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience working with enterprise customers to understand needs and shape product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator who can make complex backend topics understandable to engineering, customers, and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable connecting platform investments to concrete customer outcomes and business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energized by fast-moving startup environments with competing priorities and real ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
